   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0435_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>Y̱LYDWNṭ hlṭ-wndʾṭ ʾwsṭʾndʾl grmkˈ gwpṭ ʾYḴ
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>pṭyhwyh Y QDM p(ʾ)ṭglʾḇ MNW ẔNH
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>ʾḇyˈʾṭkʾl ʾwb-š wylʾsṭˈ npšṭˈ YKʿYMWNt
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>PWN YḆLWNṭn grmkdʾn MNW ẔNH YWM ʿL
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>bwnˈ YḤWWNṭ hngʾlṭnˈ lʾd ẔNH BYRḤ ddwˈ
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>Y ŠNṬ $X-III-III dynʾp̄ẕwṭˈ plmʾn YḤBWNṭ
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>W bnd Y ẔNH ʾḇyȳʾṭkʾl ʾwsṭʾndʾl ḤṬYMWNṭ 
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0435_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>zād xrad-windād ōstāndār garmak gift kū
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>padēxīh ī abar pā̆dīrāy kē ēn
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ayādgār awi-š wirāst nibišt *ēstēd
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>pad burdan garmakdān kē ēn rōz ō
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>bun būd hangārdan rāy ēn māh Day
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>ī sāl 36 Dēnabzūd framān dād
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>ud band ī ēn ayādgār ōstāndār āwišt ◯◯
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0435_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Born with inherited wisdom, Ōstāndār, *beans, viz.
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>the *harvest, on which this receipt on which this
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>memoir (reminder) has been established and written,
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>(viz. that) Dēnabzūd ordered to bring the container of beans which, on this day, was due to the
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>bun, to estimate (it) this month Day (10th month)
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>of the year 36.
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>And the Ōstāndār sealed the tie of this memoir.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>